+
+Triggers: `pull_request`, `merge_group`, and push to the protected default
+branch. Apple/Core jobs run on a declared GitHub-hosted macOS image with pinned
+Xcode, Mise/Tuist, Swift, Go, and dependency inputs. Relay-only jobs may retain
+declared GitHub-hosted native Linux rows, but the macOS working-client path does
+not depend on their availability. No self-hosted or credentialed runner is
+permitted.
