+| `security/supply-chain` | Same; source, locks, built candidates, policies | `contents: read`; `security-events: write` only if the repository's reviewed SARIF upload policy requires it; no environment or production secret | Advisory DB fetch only from an allowlisted pinned scanner source; failure is not a pass | Redacted secret/dependency/license/SBOM/notice reports; verification/90d | None |
