+| `release/relay-stage` | Exact compliance-approved digests | `contents: read`; protected `relay-staging`; narrowly scoped staging credential if a remote store is used | Only the named staging endpoint | Immutable digest-addressed staging receipt; release-record/7y | Environment approval by release owner |
