+### 2210 — CI trust boundary and fail-closed quality gates fixed (TASK-260715-whtdsf)
+- DECISION: Pull-request and merge-queue work is credential-free, GitHub-hosted macOS only, read-only by default, and unable to reach protected environments, production secrets, privileged runners, publication permissions, or trusted release cache/artifact namespaces. Every third-party action is full-SHA pinned.
