environments, stable required-check policy, provenance/retention/network rules,
and deterministic failure semantics for the macOS-first and later macOS/relay
release paths.

Gate A0 and iOS/TestFlight/App Store remain deferred and are never inferred as
passes. Existing Linux relay-native hardening is allowed, but no Linux CI runner
is an architectural prerequisite for the macOS working-client path.

